From 673458ea0f5a1a975b7be9023f8f66627820e73c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Entrpi <entrpi@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Feb 2026 23:32:47 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 056/145] ASoC/ALSA: CIX Sky1 audio fixes

HDA:
- Add CIX Phecda board fixup (SSID 0x10ec:0x129e) to disable
  auto mic switching, allowing internal DMIC use with headset

I2S-SC:
- Change startup to prepare callback for proper FIFO reset timing
- Drain TX FIFO before disable to fix residue data in full-duplex
- Fix 192KHz mclk_fs from 128 to 256 for proper codec operation
- Set trigger ordering for DMA vs I2S sequencing
---
